etry exists for exp4544, so gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null is the honest value (not a flag). Research substance (on-disk, for context, NOT in the locked retro numbers): A1 LLM-proposer re-induction did NOT raise core_efficiency above baseline 2.0074 (positive control failed, false_negative_risk open, honest negative -- exp4544); capstone efficiency_moved=false (exp4554); A4 frame-change CNN gave no action reduction (honest null -- exp4547); A5 integration found no lever raises core_efficiency (exp4548) -- BUT A2 cross-game DiscriminativeVerifier LOO-AUROC reached 0.674 above chance (oracle-distinct, verifier_is_oracle:false -- exp4545) and A3 banked su15 L2 offline-reproduced (+1 reproducible level -- exp4546); B1/B2 shipped honest-sprint-metric + offline/live proposer-parity guards (exp4550/exp4551); hardware continuity = 2 boards reachable (exp4552). Bottleneck = observability, not execution. Highest-leverage fix (thrice-recommended) = MOVE the shipped detector-wire to the conductor's retro TIMING-DATA prompt-assembly call site + promote injected==on-disk to a HARD retro-launch gate + write-time duration_s/inference_substrate/compute_bound stamping in experiment_template.py (would have surfaced exp4544) + device-attributed in-window GPU telemetry so gpu_idle resolves for real compute-bound runs. estimated_time_savings_pct=4 (saves retro-reconciliation turns; experiment wall-time was not the bottleneck). results/operational_retro_2026_06_420.json
